            <ArticleTitle>Ongoing risk stratification trials: the primary prevention of sudden death.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47S-51S</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper reviews three ongoing risk stratification trials: the Coronary Artery Bypass Grafting-Patch Trial (CABG-Patch), the Multicenter Automatic Implantable Defibrillator Trial (MADIT), and the Multicenter Unsustained Tachycardia Trial (MUSTT).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
